example.policy_excerpt:
II. Continued Therapy — E. All Other Indications:
Member meets one of the following (a, b, c, d, or e):
  a. For RA: [RA-specific criteria]
  b. For HS: At least a 25% reduction in inflammatory nodules and abscesses;
  c. For AD: Member is responding positively to therapy as evidenced by reduction
     in itching and scratching;
  d. For PMR: Member is responding positively to therapy as evidenced by decrease
     in signs and symptoms and reduction in CRP/ESR;
  e. For all other indications: Member is responding positively to therapy;
Approval duration: For all other indications - 12 months

